     <H1><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlmaintitle_label" style='display:none'>MainTitleHeader</div><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlmaintitle__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField" class="ms-rtestate-field" style="display:inline" aria-labelledby="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlmaintitle_label"><p>​<span style="font-size&#58;32px;">Tuesday, November 3, 2026&#160;- Special Bond Election</span><br></p></div></H1>
    <H2><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlsubtitle_label" style='display:none'>SubTitleHeader</div><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlsubtitle__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField" class="ms-rtestate-field" style="display:inline" aria-labelledby="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlsubtitle_label"><p>​<em class="ms-rteForeColor-2" style="font-size&#58;24.64px;">Notice of Election Results City of Dallas -TBA</em><br></p></div></H2>
 <div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField2_label" style='display:none'>Page Content</div><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField2__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField" class="ms-rtestate-field" style="display:inline" aria-labelledby="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField2_label">​​<div style="display&#58;inline;"><table class="ms-rteTable-4" cellspacing="0" style="background-color&#58;#ffffff;width&#58;737.266px;height&#58;511px;"><tbody><tr class="ms-rteTableHeaderRow-4" style="text-align&#58;justify;"><th class="ms-rteTableHeaderEvenCol-4" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3"><span style="font-weight&#58;700;text-decoration&#58;underline;">November 3, 2026 - Special Election</span>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <span class="ms-rteFontSize-3 ms-rteForeColor-2"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3 ms-rteForeColor-2" style="text-decoration&#58;underline;"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3 ms-rteForeColor-2" style="text-decoration&#58;underline;"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-4" style="text-decoration&#58;underline;">&#160;</span><a href="https&#58;//www.dallascountyvotes.org/election-results/historical/november-3-2026-general-and-joint-election/#EarlyVoting"><span class="ms-rteForeColor-2 ms-rteFontSize-4" style="text-decoration&#58;underline;">ELECTION​&#160;RESULTS</span>​</a></span></span></span><span class="ms-rteForeColor-2 ms-rteFontSize-3" style="font-weight&#58;700;"><br></span><font class="ms-rteFontFace-1 ms-rteFontSize-3"><span style="font-family&#58;lato;line-height&#58;15.6933px;">The purpose of submitting is that it is necessary and advisable to call and hold an election in the City for the purpose of submitting certain propositions pertaining to the issuance of bonds for the purposes as hereinafter set forth.<br></span><br></font></span></div><div><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3"></span><span class="ms-rteThemeForeColor-1-0 ms-rteFontSize-3"><em><a href="/government/citysecretary/elections/Pages/ADHOCC_NOV2026ELE.aspx?ControlMode=Edit&amp;DisplayMode=Design"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3" style="color&#58;#ffffff;">Ad Hoc City Council Canvassing&#160;Committee - Attachments and Reports</span></a></em></span><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3">&#160;</span><br></div></th></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableOddRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3"><span style="font-weight&#58;700;">Election Order​&#58;</span><br>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; (Ordinance No. <a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/ORDINANCE_33494.pdf" style="text-decoration&#58;underline;">33494​</a>; adopted by the Dallas City Council on August 12, 2026)</span></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableEvenRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1">​<strong class="ms-rteFontSize-3">Voter Information Documents </strong>(<a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/VID.pdf">ENGLISH</a>​) (<a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/VID.pdf#page=3">SPANISH</a>​) (<a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/VID.pdf#page=5">VIETNAMESE​</a>​)<br></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableOddRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3">​<span style="font-weight&#58;700;">Dallas, Collin and Denton Counties Information&#58;</span></span></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableEvenRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3">​<span style="font-weight&#58;700;">Press Release/Notice&#58;</span><br>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Dallas County | Collin County | Denton County</span></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableOddRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3" style="font-weight&#58;700;">​City of Dallas Information&#58;</span></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableEvenRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1" style="width&#58;545px;"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3">​<span style="font-weight&#58;700;">Notice of Election&#58;&#160;​<br></span><a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/ELE_NOTICE.pdf">English</a> | <a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/ELE_NOTICE.pdf#page=6">Spanish</a> | <a href="https&#58;//citysecretary2.dallascityhall.com//pdf/Elections/2026/ELE_NOTICE.pdf#page=12">Vietnamese​</a><br>Affidavit of Posting Notice - City Website (PDF)<br>Affidavit of Posting Notice - City Locations (PDF)​</span></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableOddRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3">​<span style="font-weight&#58;700;">Sample Ballot&#58;&#160;</span><br>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<a href="https&#58;//www.dallascountyvotes.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Full-Sample-Ballot-Watermark-8.5x14-Legal_110326.pdf" target="_blank">&#160;Dallas County</a> | <a href="https&#58;//www.collincountytx.gov/docs/default-source/elections/sample-ballots/20261103_joint-general-and-special-election_all-race-sample-ballot_final.pdf?sfvrsn=e253de7b_5" target="_blank">Collin County</a> | <a href="https&#58;//www.votedenton.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1126-Active-Contest-List.pdf" target="_blank">Denton County​</a>&#160;</span></td></tr><tr class="ms-rteTableEvenRow-4"><td class="ms-rteTableEvenCol-4" rowspan="1"><span class="ms-rteFontSize-3">​<span style="font-weight&#58;700;"><a href="/government/citysecretary/elections/Pages/Nov2026.aspx" name="&quot;EV&quot;" id="&quot;EV&quot;"><span class="ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-4">Early Voting Locations&#58;</span>​</a><br></span></span><table cellspacing="0" class="ms-rteTable-0" style="width&#58;100%;height&#58;24px;"><tbody><tr class="ms-rteTableEvenRow-0"